// BT-3981: runs the cells of fixtures/bt3981evalblock_{actor,value,class}.bt:
// an evaluated block that binds a local answers the value wherever the compiler
// accepts it. The actor cells that answered the raw {Value, State} tuple are
// compile errors (PIN-BUG BT-3947 for the correct answer).

